{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22653","headline":"八月十五日夜闻崔大员外翰林独直对酒玩月因怀禁中清景偶题是诗 · 白居易","name":"八月十五日夜闻崔大员外翰林独直对酒玩月因怀禁中清景偶题是诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋月高悬空碧外，仙郎静玩禁闱间。\n岁中唯有今宵好，海内无如此地闲。\n皓色分明双阙牓，清光深到九门关。\n遥闻独醉还惆怅，不见金波照玉山。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22653.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22653","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}